WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Correlation lets a reviewer
follow the failure across systems.

00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:08.560
Join the run, test, trace,
transfer and idempotency key.

00:00:08.656 --> 00:00:13.440
Link the failing assertion to request
attempts and committed journal facts,

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:16.560
then to the build, fixture
and provider-model versions.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.760
Retries remain separate events
within the same scenario.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:25.120
Preserve the original artifacts and redact
sensitive values before AI input.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.520
A missing join remains unresolved,

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.200
and a generated hypothesis cannot
replace the failed assertion.
